  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & (x-2)^2+(y-3)^2-12-13=0 \\\\ & (x-2)^2+(y-3)^2=5^2 \\\\ & (x+3)^2+(y+9)^2=-26+9+81=64 \\\\ & C_1(2,3) \\quad r_1=5 \\\\ & C_2(-3,-9) \\quad r_2=8 \\\\ & C_1 C_2=\\sqrt{25+144}=13 \\\\ & C_1 C_2=r_1+r_2 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 3 \\text { common tangents. }\\end{aligned}$",
